{
  "about": "Kinetic lyric library: how a meaning word performs (acts), how the other words arrive (entrances), how a line sits in the frame (layouts), and a transparent layer over the section (overlays: a HyperFrames registry block with a blend mode and opacity; blocks drawn on black use screen so the black disappears). Read by words.save/compose/apply. Letterings are named style presets; strokes are hand-drawn marks a design anchors to a word (drawn on at its sung time).",
  "acts": {
    "jump": {
      "name": "Jump",
      "does": "Springs up from below",
      "from": {
        "y": 50,
        "opacity": 0
      },
      "to": {
        "y": 0,
        "opacity": 1,
        "duration": 0.45,
        "ease": "back.out(3)"
      }
    },
    "drop": {
